{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 microFISHER</strong> is a <strong>cozy</strong> and relaxing fishing game where your ultimate goal is to collect every fish specimen. To achieve this, you must explore and discover various lakes, each home to a unique fish that your team is aiming for. The fishing system is simple yet engaging, featuring a timing-based mechanic. A bar spins around a circle, and you must carefully time your catch by hitting the bar when it turns blue. While easy to learn, this mechanic can become a fun and rewarding challenge as you chase after bigger fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633940/extras/0b4e6b394f85d124af54372e468b7198.poster.avif?t=1765910498\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633940/extras/0b4e6b394f85d124af54372e468b7198.webm?t=1765910498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633940/extras/0b4e6b394f85d124af54372e468b7198.mp4?t=1765910498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 To become the best fisherman</strong>, you will need to venture across different islands in search of essential upgrades. The toolbox upgrade allows you to cast your fishing line farther, giving you access to bigger and much-wanted fish. Meanwhile, finding bucket upgrades increases the number of fish that you can carry, allowing for longer and more productive fishing sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633940/extras/f73ca4e4d8c7f541e48f692d17fbcda0.poster.avif?t=1765910498\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633940/extras/f73ca4e4d8c7f541e48f692d17fbcda0.webm?t=1765910498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633940/extras/f73ca4e4d8c7f541e48f692d17fbcda0.mp4?t=1765910498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Your personal fishing camp</strong> serves as a home, where you can store and manage your fishing gear. Here, you\u2019ll find all your fishing rods and a <strong>cozy</strong> tent where you can track your progress and view the fish you've caught. Along the way, you might discover a wooden tub. This is a valuable upgrade for your base. It acts as a fish storage place, allowing you to empty your buckets, making your fishing trips more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633940/extras/cd3cfd9fd4f17ea9a7bb1245d7c120f6.poster.avif?t=1765910498\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633940/extras/cd3cfd9fd4f17ea9a7bb1245d7c120f6.webm?t=1765910498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633940/extras/cd3cfd9fd4f17ea9a7bb1245d7c120f6.mp4?t=1765910498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Whether you're a seasoned</strong> angler or just looking for a peaceful adventure, <strong>microFISHER</strong> invites you to relax and explore. Cast your line, upgrade your gear, and become the ultimate fishing master! </p>","background":"